Package: tidycreel.connect
Title: Database and File Connections for Tidycreel
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christopher", "Chizinski", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cchizinski2@unl.edu")
Description: Provides connection objects and data loaders for the tidycreel
    creel survey analysis package. Loads data from flat CSV files and from
    REST APIs described by a caller-supplied profile. Connections to SQL
    Server (via ODBC) and other DBI-compliant databases can be constructed,
    but their data loaders are not implemented yet.
